        "title": "Serene",
        "text": "I regret not reaching the place earlier. It was my last day in Kathmandu and I reached temple at around 6:45 in the evening, time when temple was about to close and aarti (hindu prayers) was being sung. However, amidst the sound of aarti, jumping monkeys, people from vivid places I found the magical tranquility in the atmosphere. \nPashupatinath temple is dedicated to Lord Shiva and i definitely felt his presence there. I wish I could have stayed there longer.",
